{"overview":"چنگ شیائوشی و لو گوانگ با استفاده از ابرقدرت‌ها برای وارد کردن عکس‌های مشتریان خود به صورت یک به یک، کار خود را در \"استودیوی عکس زمان\"، یک کارگاه عکاسی کوچک در پس‌زمینه یک کلان‌شهر مدرن، جدی می‌گیرند. هر کار می‌تواند پر از خطر باشد، اما هیچ چیز مهم‌تر از انجام هر سفارش، صرف نظر از مقیاس یا خطر مربوطه، نیست!","tagline":"","overview_en":"Using superpowers to enter their clientele’s photos one by one, Cheng Xiaoshi and Lu Guang take their work seriously at “Time Photo Studio,” a small photography shop set in the backdrop of a modern metropolis. Each job can be full of danger, but nothing is more important than fulfilling every order, no matter the scale…or peril involved!","tagline_en":"Past or future, just let them be.","runtime":23,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":28,"y":2021,"poster":"/6uqoiBppiQqBPUrFqlJtTDRc0Bq.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":11,"y":2021,"poster":"/8uBae3fsFRhYNrNBxuWJCXlBFKE.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":12,"y":2023,"poster":"/4BFRcTcdnE9UCaJWfBWz0SBymrm.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":6,"y":2024,"poster":"/r9Z7eC0TWNK78JonjSjeZxHx7pJ.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":12,"y":2026,"poster":"/d3zD25f4VY3rGlv7QOQDGQYRGn6.jpg"},{"n":5,"name":"فصل 5","ep":0,"y":null,"poster":""}],"episodes":41,"crew":["李豪凌"],"crew_en":["Li Haoling"],"countries":["CN"],"cast":[{"name":"苏尚卿","role":"Cheng Xiaoshi (voice)","photo":"/mbTikaoO6lPtiHwJB1PzAqxYE27.jpg","en":"Su Shangqing"},{"name":"杨天翔","role":"Lu Guang (voice)","photo":"/jEwKu9VEtl0ecc6oA264U3iJV08.jpg","en":"Yang Tianxiang"},{"name":"李詩萌","role":"Qiao Ling (voice)","photo":"/i7hKjBsuxiMHuj3v68yWhbLXNbi.jpg","en":"Li Shimeng"}],"trailer":"HxoR_7jVBCM","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/123542/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Crunchyroll","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/uFL3c4Cq8M6WoLymlC5Y8bmGytV.png"},{"n":"Crunchyroll Amazon Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/qHLLmKo7udRgiSnIASVTwP2IxfJ.png"}]},"GB":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/12354